# AI Matchmaking Platform — TechTitans

A microservices-based collaborative sandbox with AI facilitation and a Web3 trust layer. This MVP demonstrates expert matchmaking via vector similarity, real-time AI-translated chat, a brainstorm facilitator agent, and blockchain contribution logging.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **API Keys needed before running:**
> - `GEMINI_API_KEY` — Used by the Python AI service for translation + facilitation (Google Gemini via LangChain). Free tier available at [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com).
> - `PINECONE_API_KEY` + `PINECONE_ENV` — For vector-based expert matching. Free tier at [pinecone.io](https://pinecone.io). **Optional**: local fallback (cosine similarity with sentence-transformers) will be used if not configured.
> - Blockchain (Polygon Mumbai) requires a testnet wallet private key. **Optional for MVP demo** — a local Hardhat node is used by default.
> - MySQL must be installed and running locally.

> [!WARNING]
> The Python AI service requires Python 3.9+ and pip. The Node.js backend requires Node 18+. The blockchain service requires Node 18+ with Hardhat.

