### AI Service (Python + FastAPI)

#### [NEW] `ai-service/main.py`
- FastAPI app with endpoints:
  - `POST /translate` — translates jargon using Gemini LLM
  - `POST /match` — matches users via embedding similarity (sentence-transformers + optionally Pinecone)
  - `POST /facilitate` — suggests brainstorming prompts based on conversation
  - `POST /summarize` — generates chat summary
  - `GET /health`

#### [NEW] `ai-service/agents/translator.py`
- LangChain chain: detects domain → rewrites message in plain language

#### [NEW] `ai-service/agents/facilitator.py`
- Given conversation history → suggests next question

#### [NEW] `ai-service/agents/matchmaker.py`
- Encodes user skills + problem statement → cosine similarity → top matches

#### [NEW] `ai-service/requirements.txt`

#### [NEW] `ai-service/.env.example`

